    "updated_at": "2024-11-20T19:34:54Z",
    "body": "Done. I'm not sure of the HTTP citation because HTTP itself says [whitespace is just space and tab](https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc9110.html#whitespace). Fetch and mimesniff include CR/LF and FF inconsistently. So I went with \"parts of HTTP\" and a link to the Fetch definition. I don't have a strong opinion between `note` and `warning`.",
